### 7: AUTENTICAÇÃO (TOKEN EM FALTA OU INVÁLIDO)
### ==========================================

### 7. GET Sem token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-scenarios
?? status == 401

### 7.1 POST Sem token (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplier-scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sem_Token",
  "suppliers": [],
  "products": []
}
?? status == 401

### 7.2 PUT Sem token (401 Unauthorized)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/supplier-scenarios/{{scenarioId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}
?? status == 401

### 7.3 GET Com token inválido (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplier-scenarios
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido
?? status == 401
